      "writtenOn": "2023-12-14T17:47:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "why is this needed btw? this type of API has been pretty problematic for fuzzers, but typically I\u0027d expect clients to open sessions and not be able to affect each other. If they can mess with each other, it could cause some issues?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 95,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 98,
