    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "de7b2674_e01da57f",
        "filename": "security/secretkeeper/aidl/android/hardware/security/secretkeeper/ISecretkeeper.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 98,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-14T17:53:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Clients won\u0027t get any access to this. (They don\u0027t actually get direct access to anything in the HAL, but this API will only be used by virtualization service and not exposed to VMs.)\n\nThe reason we want it is that some storage will be managed by the TA, and some by virtualization service. After a factory reset we want to be able to tell the TA that it should wipe all its storage, since all the VMs are by definition gone.\n\nVMs definitely don\u0027t get to mess with other VM\u0027s data.",
      "parentUuid": "7bab04a3_9e3438ba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 95,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 98,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "1357b92dbc687a43fbb702cd818ac806110769e6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "37c82ff9_78303844",
        "filename": "security/secretkeeper/aidl/android/hardware/security/secretkeeper/ISecretkeeper.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 98,
      "author": {
        "id": 1897307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-14T17:53:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These are for supporting cases like factory reset. The ids are stored in /data/ partition, which will be gone after FR, we would like to have a method to clear the Secretkeeper database altogether.\n\nNote deletion are not done by the client (VM) directly. A global (virtualization) service will track all Id, and on app uninstalls or Factory reset (a client app cannot delete its secret if it is iteself uninstalled ;) ), call the relevant deletion api.",
      "parentUuid": "7bab04a3_9e3438ba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 95,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 98,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "1357b92dbc687a43fbb702cd818ac806110769e6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
